    <string name="about_description">PaperNotes by BOB is a note-taking app for handwritten notes on the Huawei Paper (E-Ink). Notes are stored as files in the Documents/PaperNotes folder and can be organized in folders, shared, exported as PDF and restored from the trash. Automatic backups, import of HiNote notes and a one-way sync to Nextcloud are built in.</string>
